.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.VSCodeCounter
# Quick benchmark runs (npm run bench -- --quick). Full runs go to docs/decisions/data/.
bench/results/
# The ramp's raw k6 output is a few hundred MB a run, too big for git. Its per-second totals
# (seconds.jsonl) are committed instead, and give throughput exactly.
docs/decisions/data/*-ramp-*/*/run-*/k6.json.gz
# Steady at 15,000 req/s is about 900,000 requests a run, 7 MB compressed. Its summary.md,
# spread.md, redis-calls.json and k6-summary.json are committed; the raw records stay local.
docs/decisions/data/*-steady-15000rps-*/*/run-*/requests.jsonl.gz
# Mutation testing (npm run mutate): reports and Stryker's sandbox.
reports/
.stryker-tmp/
